{"1-14":{"people":[{"id":"absalom-h0053","name":"Absalom","kind":"person","brief":"David's son","count":7,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"ahithophel-h0302","name":"Ahithophel","kind":"person","brief":"David's compatriot","count":4,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"david-h1732","name":"David","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":1,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":5,"firstVerse":4},{"id":"hushai-h2365","name":"Hushai","kind":"person","brief":"David's compatriot","count":5,"firstVerse":5},{"id":"archites-h0757","name":"Archites","kind":"person","brief":"","count":2,"firstVerse":5}],"places":[{"id":"beersheba-h0884","name":"Beersheba","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"dan-h1835g","name":"Dan","kind":"place","brief":"In Dan","count":1,"firstVerse":11}],"words":[{"base":"H0053","lemma":"אֲבִישָׁלוֹם","tr":"a·vi·sha·lom","gloss":"Absalom","lang":"h","inPassage":9,"uses":111},{"base":"H2365","lemma":"חוּשַׁי","tr":"chu·shay","gloss":"Hushai","lang":"h","inPassage":5,"uses":14},{"base":"H0302","lemma":"אֲחִיתֹ֫פֶל","tr":"a·chi·to·phel","gloss":"Ahithophel","lang":"h","inPassage":5,"uses":20},{"base":"H6098","lemma":"עֵצָה","tr":"e·tsah","gloss":"counsel","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":89},{"base":"H1571","lemma":"גַּם","tr":"gam","gloss":"also","lang":"h","inPassage":5,"uses":769},{"base":"H0757","lemma":"אַרְכִּי","tr":"ar·ki","gloss":"Archite","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":6},{"base":"H0622","lemma":"אָסַף","tr":"a·saph","gloss":"to gather","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":200},{"base":"H0854","lemma":"אֵת","tr":"et","gloss":"with","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":929},{"base":"H0259","lemma":"אֶחָד","tr":"e·chad","gloss":"one","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":970},{"base":"H4549","lemma":"מָסַס","tr":"ma·sas","gloss":"to melt","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":21}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"2SA","chapter":15,"verse":34,"verseEnd":34,"votes":8,"source":"both","text":"But you can thwart the counsel of Ahithophel for me if you return to the city and say to Absalom: ‘I will be your servant, my king; in the past I was your fatherʼs servant, but now I will be your servant.’","from":14},{"book":"HOS","chapter":13,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"Like a bear robbed of her cubs I will attack them, and I will tear open their chests. There I will devour them like a lion, like a wild beast tearing them apart.","from":8},{"book":"1CO","chapter":1,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":6,"source":"openbible","text":"For it is written: “I will destroy the wisdom of the wise; the intelligence of the intelligent I will frustrate.”","from":14},{"book":"1CO","chapter":1,"verse":20,"verseEnd":20,"votes":6,"source":"openbible","text":"Where is the wise man? Where is the scribe? Where is the philosopher of this age? Has not God made foolish the wisdom of the world?","from":14},{"book":"GEN","chapter":22,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"I will surely bless you, and I will multiply your descendants like the stars in the sky and the sand on the seashore. Your descendants will possess the gates of their enemies.","from":11},{"book":"2SA","chapter":16,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Finally, the king and all the people with him arrived, exhausted. And there he refreshed himself.","from":2},{"book":"1KI","chapter":22,"verse":31,"verseEnd":31,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Now the king of Aram had ordered his thirty-two chariot commanders, “Do not fight with anyone, small or great, except the king of Israel.”","from":2},{"book":"ISA","chapter":8,"verse":10,"verseEnd":10,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Devise a plan, but it will be thwarted; state a proposal, but it will not happen. For God is with us.”","from":14}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"kings-prophets","title":"Kings, prophets and the house of David","people":4}]},"15-22":{"people":[{"id":"absalom-h0053","name":"Absalom","kind":"person","b